{
  "id": "compare_best_price",
  "name": "查询最优价格",
  "description": "当用户询问哪个价格最低、哪个方案最划算、实时价格对比时使用。",
  "parameters": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "product_name": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "用户想要查询价格的商品名称"
      },
      "city": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "用户所在城市，可选"
      }
    },
    "required": ["product_name"]
  },
  "max_steps": 6,
  "workflow": [
    {
      "id": "fetch_prices",
      "type": "script",
      "entry": "steps/fetch_prices.js"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge_next",
      "type": "llm",
      "instruction": "你正在执行查询最优价格技能。请根据 fetch_prices 的结果判断是否已经足够回答用户。如果价格结果为空，返回 {\"next_step\":\"finish\",\"summary\":\"没有查到可用价格\"}。如果有结果，返回 {\"next_step\":\"build_result\",\"reason\":\"已有可比较价格\"}。",
      "choices": ["build_result", "finish"]
    },
    {
      "id": "build_result",
      "type": "script",
      "entry": "steps/build_result.js"
    }
  ]
}
